      ],
      "en": "“No doubt, but you are the people, and wisdom will die with you.",
      "ko": "너희만 참으로 사람이로구나 너희가 죽으면 지혜도 죽겠구나",
      "source_text_hash": "5bc507aa7f94696fa91b8c276c188c19e27508c6d6464130d553f6b9bc7f7fd9",
      "translation_text_hash": "f395042f6dd942989f181e223bd73bf01b1bd7a7f9dad8a5a05523953bbe6fdc",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너희만 참으로 사람이로구나 너희가 죽으면 지혜도 죽겠구나"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f395042f6dd942989f181e223bd73bf01b1bd7a7f9dad8a5a05523953bbe6fdc"
      ]
    },
    {
