      "en": "Behold, he breaks down, and it can’t be built again. He imprisons a man, and there can be no release.",
      "ko": "그가 헐으신즉 다시 세울 수 없고 사람을 가두신즉 놓이지 못하느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "511c9cf143f34a2b12985503086f1ad0485bb8146559ba5216f7cf2149a65ebc",
      "translation_text_hash": "01c0fba68aa78ba0ddb31c9bf7286a6ea118fbe113ebfbd91f57424a397658d7",
