      "en": "Behold, he withholds the waters, and they dry up. Again, he sends them out, and they overturn the earth.",
      "ko": "그가 물을 그치게 하신즉 곧 마르고 물을 내신즉 곧 땅을 뒤집나니",
      "source_text_hash": "3effa55e959c4c5bd4c8ce99647eb797d8d8a564d7c52f0cd8360bcb8095e42c",
